window.products.push({"id":1050116,"name":"Ted Baker Royal Palm 3-Piece Cotton Sateen Comforter Set w/Shams, Flower Design, 108ʺW x 96ʺL, King, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MKmDyjnQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Escape into a regal retreat with the Royal Palm Collection from Ted Baker. A beautiful garden of floral designs come into full bloom across the luxuriously textured ribbed fabric. Intricate details such as scattered gemstone print, hand-drawn paisley motifs, and a delicate corded edge are a few of the unexpected details you'll continue to discover in this radiantly beautiful collection. Transform your bedroom into a work of art with Ted Baker. This set is perfect for anyone who wants to add a touch of feminine charm to the bedroom. The floral botanical print features gorgeous wildflowers in shades of pink, blue, yellow, white, and green, accented by elegant hand-drawn details. This 3-piece comforter set includes a comforter and two matching pillow shams. The Ted Baker Royal Palm Comforter Set is a natural choice for anyone who wants to bring a radiant garden into their bedroom or guestroom. The 100% cotton ottoman ribbed fabric is cool to the touch, highly textured, and comfortable all year long in any season from summer to winter. This material is also easy to clean and can be machine washed, as per the care instructions on the sewn-on label. The fill is 100% polyester for warm comfort every night. This look becomes a complete work of art when paired with white bed sheets, the Ted Baker Royal Palm Throw Pillow and the Ted Baker Bow Coverlet in blue. Ted Baker: From the beginning Ted has had a very clear, unswerving, focus on quality, attention to detail, and a quirky sense of humor, so much so in fact that the first stores used to provide a laundry service for every shirt purchased – something that gained the quickly growing brand the title of ‘No Ordinary Designer Label’. Everything produced under the Ted Baker name has his personality woven into its very heart. About The Ted Baker Royal Palm Comforter Bed Set Package Contents: Ted Baker Royal Palm Comforter (1), Ted Baker Royal Palm Shams (2) Face Material: 100% ottoman ribbed cotton Fill Material: 100% polyester Pattern: Floral Sizes: Twin (68ʺW x 88ʺL), Full/Queen (92ʺW x 96ʺL), King (108ʺW x 96ʺL) Origin: Pakistan Care Instructions: Machine wash Items Featured in Photo (sold separately): Ted Baker Royal Palm Throw Pillow, Ted Baker Bow Coverlet (Blue), Ted Baker Bow Shams (Blue)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MKmDyjnQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ted Baker","source_asin":"B08ZN8PNTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZN8PNTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZN8PNTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
