window.products.push({"id":1050189,"name":"Befion Digital Alarm Clock Mirror Nightlight Bed Shaker|Extra Loud Vibrating Alarm Clock for Heavy Sleepers and Deaf Hearing Impaired|3 Level Manual&A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VDf+bW6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLEASE NOTE: The backup memory battery is only used to store your settings,not to power the alarm. 【Wake You Up with Hearing and Touching】Unlike regular alarm clocks,our vibrating alarm clock include a bed shaker to provide more probability to wake you up for deaf, hard hearing, heavy sleeper.As our testing,we still feel the shake strongly after putting it under a 5.1\" pillow,the strong vibrating motion and loud buzzer will jostle you awake as once as the loud alarm clock goes off. 【A Big Snooze Button】A crucial reprieve \"just more 5-60 minutes\" to protect everyone from your own worst impulses to close the digital mirror alarm clock entirely and sleep in all day.Our snooze button is the biggest button on shock alarm clock and set it on a separate top position,for someone who may fumble blindly in a too early morning. 【Darkness Matters-3 Levels Brightness】Depend on the sensitive of light,our digital clock design 3 adjustable brightness mode of the display from extremely bright to barely visible to avoiding the interfere with both the quantity and quality of sleep. Automatic&Manual dimming set&Night mode.which help you to choose your most comfortable brightness based on the ambient light. 【Extra Night Light】4 levels adjustable brightness shaker nightlight fade from darkest to brightest to avoid the bad mood caused by sudden light,and help guide you safely out of bedroom if you tend to wake up to use restroom or others.And then make you sleep easier again by transiting from low brightness to complete darkness. 【Large Display for Trouble Vision Person】This 6.18\" modern mirror alarm clock clearly show the time with 12H/24H mode,and it has a black background with white letters shining brightly making it very easy to be seen from across the room and easy to read without glasses in the dark. 【Power Off Memory Function】The backup memory battery(included) to store your settings in case of suddenly power outage,and the display goes black and alarm will not sound until the power returns,and you do not need to set our bed shaking alarm clock again.Notice,Please tear off the insulating plastic paper before use to turn on the memory function.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VDf+bW6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Befion","source_asin":"B09NDKZ8DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NDKZ8DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NDKZ8DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
