window.products.push({"id":1050192,"name":"GreenTraveler NEW Multi Compartment Lunch Box, Food Container, Perfect for Hiking, Camping, Fishing, Picnics and all Family Outdoor Fun! Dishwasher an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41il0-9pR0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Here at GreenTraveler we are peacefully fighting against styrofoam, and even compostable to-go containers that end up in the landfill - waxed cardboard, disposable coffee cups, and plastic bags. What matters to each consumer is convenience. We made a product for convenience that is also more sustainable. Feel good when using your GreenTraveler! How often do you wish you had your favorite food with you to avoid going hungry or spending money on over-priced restaurant food? While trying to use other portable containers, we were tired of leaks, spills, having only one compartment leaving our food soggy, inconvenient shapes and sizes that don't fit in a bag, and throwing away disposable to-go containers that didn't work very well anyway. Thinking back, you may have memories of battling some problems that standard food containers pose... With GreenTraveler everywhere as your primary container you may be amazed how many uses it has - keep liquids in, keep rain and water out, store food and beverages, use for first aid or baby supplies, or for any items you need protected. What? For us at GreenTraveler, the world's most convenient, waste-free, portable container is a cylinder with carabiner loops and 6 compartments that won't leak, spill or break. It was modeled from a water bottle, which we carry everywhere to avoid disposable plastic bottles... the same problem. For this size and shape plastic is still the best material. But don't be afraid of it. We made sure it has no BPA or phthalates so it won't leach chemicals in your food, even in a microwave. Chances are you are already eating out of plastic with food you buy at the grocery store or your containers at home. The plastic used in the Original GreenTraveler is approved by the food safety foundations for food around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41il0-9pR0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenTraveler","source_asin":"B07FHLLZR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FHLLZR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FHLLZR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
