window.products.push({"id":1050206,"name":"300 Pcs Cookie Candy Bags Self Adhesive Bakery Decorating bags Biscuit Roasting Gift DIY Plastic Bag for Merry Chrismas Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tA7iCwFvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: SIZE：4*4 inch and the length of self-adhesive is about 1.3*4 inch Includes：300 pack Warning tips : 1. Please fill the bags with cookies or candies gently, that will make sure the bags in perfect condition for use.  2. In daily life, do not expose treat bags to high-temperature environment  3. They may be a little error 1-2 pieces, since there are all automatic computer counts. If you are not satisfied with our favor bags or services, please feel free to contact our customer service first, we are glad to resend another one for free or arrange the 100% money back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tA7iCwFvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iziusy","source_asin":"B07WWSFHKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWSFHKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WWSFHKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1050207,"name":"INSE Vacuum Cleaner, Corded Vacuum Cleaner 600W Powerful Motor 18000Pa Versatile Handheld Corded Stick Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlLHjJg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Technical specifications: Motor Power: 600W Max Power Suction:18 Kpa Vacuum Weight: 3.3 lbs Dust Collection: bagless Dust cup: 1 liter Working Mode: Stick Vacuum Cleaner & Handheld Vacuum Cleaner Frequently Asked Questions and Answers The suction of the vacuum cleaner reduced? 1. The filter is too dirty, resulting in blockage; please wash with water and reinstall after air-dry. 2. The filter has been used for too long and is not clean. It needs to be replaced every 3-6 months according to using frequency. 3. Please check if any port is clogged or the dust cup is full (over-max-mark). 4. Make sure every connection between the components is tight especially the bottom cover of the dust cup. Sudden shutdown during use.How to deal with it? I5 corded vacuum is more powerful than most vacuum cleaner of its size. It is equipped with a strong motor so that it can provide a decent suction. It's normal that the motor part's temperature is higher than other parts. 1. If the vacuum cleaner is blocked it will lead to shut down because of overheating protection. Please check and clean any blockages & wait for about 30 minutes until the cleaner is cool down then try again. 2. If the machine can not be turned on again, please contact INSE customer to get support. If you need replacement parts and warranty, please contact INSE customer service directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlLHjJg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BQQG38M5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQQG38M5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQQG38M5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
