window.products.push({"id":1050353,"name":"Coffee/Tea Travel Mug With Handle - Stainless Steel and Black Plastic - Fits In Car Cup Holder and Under Keurigs With a 7\" Clearance - Double-Wall Ins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-8158kcDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Back to the Basics While the Market Is Booming with Fancy and High-Tech Travel Mugs, Some Key Components Have Been Compromised In the Industry - A lot of travel mugs are designed with a wide base to add style and to prevent the mug from toppling over, but mugs with that design do not fit in a standard car cup holder. - In order to accommodate serious coffee drinkers, new mugs are designed with a large capacity, making them so big that they do not fit under a Keurig. - And while the lid-lock buttons and the inner metal linings in modern mugs are high tech and preserve temperature, these designs are often hard to clean, which can result in mold build-up and bad odors. Featuring the Travel Mug That Goes Back to the Basics Designed and constructed with the same proven concepts behind thousands of travel mugs without compromising the basic features that every travel mug should have. Main Benefits - FITS IN A CAR CUP HOLDER - Because travel mugs are generally used for traveling - FITS UNDER MOST KEURIGS - Accommodating the new wave of coffee brewing - COMFORTABLE HANDLE - Easy grip and convenient curve design - EASY TO CLEAN - Black plastic interior and simple thumb slide lid - STYLISH LOOK - The two-tone stainless steel and black plastic compliment each other and give this mug an attractive look The manufacturer, FreshStart Coffee, is dedicated to customer satisfaction and offers a 60 day guarantee on this product. If you encounter any issues with your order, contact FreshStart Coffee and they will ensure that you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-8158kcDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FreshStart Coffee","source_asin":"B01HYK8GR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HYK8GR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HYK8GR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
