window.products.push({"id":1050445,"name":"Dual Event Digital Kitchen Timer for Cooking - Magnetic Timer for Classroom, Desk Smart Countdown Timer with Large Minute Display, Flashing Alarm Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQKfrlYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTREMELY SIMPLE OPERATION: The upgraded version of the kitchen timer, one-key operation, supports counting up and down. Easy to use, Just rotate to set the precise counting time and press the button on the screen to start or stop counting. The digital stopwatch timer counts down from 99 minutes and 55 seconds to zero or counts up from zero to 99 minutes and 55 seconds. The kitchen timer can memorize the settings used last time and is convenient for the next use. MAGNETIC & ULTRA-CLEAR DIGITAL DISPLAY: The back of the stopwatch timer has a magnetic attraction and two silicone pads, which can be firmly attached to metal surfaces, such as refrigerators, classroom whiteboards, cabinets, and other metal materials. The support on the back can also make it easy to stand on your countertop. The design of the mini timer is simple and stylish, with a black exterior and large 2.75 inch screen numbers that can be read even from a long distance. BUILT - IN 3*AAA BATTERIES: The battery is more durable and saves the trouble of frequent charging. It will automatically shut down within 5 seconds if no operation is displayed, which saves power and prolongs battery life. Unlike those timers made of cheap plastic, we use high-grade ABS materials to make this timer more refined and durable. Great gift for your children, family and friends for Birthday,Christmas,and New Year. MORE ACTIVITIES TO USE: The magnetic digital timer is a good helper in your kitchen when you cook, bake snacks, fry steaks, boil eggs. Two alarm volume : Loud (80-90dB), Soft (60-75dB) , you can hear the clear alarm even in another room, and it can also be silent. When the count is completed, the number will continue to flash for 60 seconds, adjust according to your needs. Suitable for fitness, games, classrooms, reading, kid's training, meetings, and other activities. 2 BRIGHTNESS LEVELS AND PACKAGING: Two brightness adjustment modes: bright and ECO. The digital timer automatically enters the power saving mode after pausing/stopping for 5 seconds, just press the button on the screen to restart. Packaging Including:1 timer, 1 instruction manual（note: the battery is not included). If you are not satisfied for any reason, please tell us, our customer service team will answer and solve your problem within 24 hours to make it positive and pleasant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TQKfrlYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOTHOD","source_asin":"B0B9H6J9QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9H6J9QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9H6J9QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
