window.products.push({"id":1050483,"name":"The Deborah Michel Collection Turkish Placemats (Set of 4), Indigo Cotton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZP7BkvT6L._AC_.jpg","description":"To create some drama at the dinner table (the good kind), set out these attention-getting Turkish cotton linens from the Deborah Michel Collection. Beautifully made, and the placemats are backed with fabric so they hold their shape. Sold in sets of four and come tied with a jute cord. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Tumble dry and iron as needed. Michel Design Works was created by Bruce & Deborah Michel in the early 1980s. The first product was an elaborate \"memory book\" called Our Country Diary. Still a favorite today, it is filled with vintage artwork, quirky quotes, notable dates and plenty of room to record all the events of the year. Our Country Diary will become a beautiful record of your family life. When they first created their signature elephant logo, it signified a remembrance of all things special. Although Michel Design Works has greatly expanded into bath & body, home fragrance and decor, when Bruce & Deborah remember and celebrate all of their wonderful customers and the company's history, it is even more fitting today! Whether you are a new or a long-time friend, we welcome you to enjoy the art, lather up with our English soaps, set an elegant table with napkins, candles, plates, and serveware, and end your day with wonderfully fragrant bubble bath.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZP7BkvT6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Michel Design Works","source_asin":"B01N35CXG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N35CXG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N35CXG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
