window.products.push({"id":1050560,"name":"Wisconsinmade Jewelry Boxes for Men from A Gift of Wood, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WywZqgZEL._AC_.jpg","description":"These Wood Jewelry Boxes for Men by Bob and Betsy St. Clair of A Gift of Wood offer a new look for a traditional style. These handsome jewelry boxes hold everything from a man's watch and jewelry to pagers, cell phones, remotes, or even decks of cards. Each jewelry box is individually handmade with your choice of Cherry, Oak, or Walnut wood. The approximate size is 8 inches long, by 5 inches wide by 3-1/2 inches high. The rectangular open interior is unlined, but finished with as much care as the exterior. A great gift for groomsmen, the graduate, or for you! Its use is just about limitless! Please note that no stain is used on any of our wood pieces. All woods are shown in their natural colors and are finished with a clear lacquer. The lacquer does not change the natural color of the wood. Cherry will naturally darken with age and become a deeper red. Walnut is a deep brown, and red oak is a light tan. Please take time to look at the photos, which illustrate the natural colors of the various woods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WywZqgZEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wisconsinmade","source_asin":"B002YJB0SQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002YJB0SQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002YJB0SQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1050561,"name":"Mueller Premium Apple Corer - Easy to Use and Durable Core Remover for Pears, Bell Peppers, Fuji, Honeycrisp, Gala and Pink Lady Apples even Cupcakes ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71--xi1iM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must Have! - Surgical Stainless-Steel Blades with sharp, serrated tips designed to smoothly core through any apple, pears, bell peppers, cupcakes and more. After coring your fruits and vegetables the blades simply open-up and dump the unwanted core for convenient disposal. Making this beautiful corer one of the most useful tools in any kitchen. Durable & Convenient - Sturdy high-quality stainless-steel blades that will not easily bend or break will allow you to core through any apple with ease. This heavy-duty corer can be also be used as a pitter and seed remover. It is a very useful tool that will last you a long time. 100% Rust proof. Smooth Ergonomic Handle - The beautiful apple-red handle is molded to give you a super comfortable and steady grip. The non-slip design makes coring easy and fun. It can be comfortably held and used by seniors and those with arthritic hands. Very Easy To Clean - Unlike other corers and slicers, this unique twin-blade apple cutter has a lever that will easily open, making it very easy to clean with a quick rinse. You can also put it in the dishwasher for a more thorough cleaning. Speeds Up Food Prepping - You will be amazed by the ease and speed with which you will core fruits and veggies compared to other apple cutters, pitters, dividers, wedger, huller, corer slicer, progressive slicer, divider and cheap plastic accessories. This prime apple, potato, onion, tomato, pineapple, zucchini and pear corer is the best way to go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71--xi1iM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mueller Austria","source_asin":"B07PWJ3FVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWJ3FVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWJ3FVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
