window.products.push({"id":1050629,"name":"Large Storage Bin 19.7 x 15.7 Inch, ZUEXT Ramie Cotton Canvas Fabric Foldable Storage Basket with Handles, Toy Box/Toy Storage/Toy Organizer, Decorati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+bDbnQBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ZUEXT Storage Bin - perfect for Toys, Clothing, Office, Closet organizer - Man, Woman, Boys and Girls With our storage bins/laundry hamper, you will have a designated spot to neatly store items and keep your family and living spaces organized and efficient while still being within the comfort of your home. Features 1. Sturdy Storage Container Hard but not too hard sided fabric material enables ZUEXT stackable storage bins stand up straight on its own. 2. Durable Quality Thicker Cotton Canvas Material ZUEXT laundry basket with waterproof PE plastic inner is made of natural ramie cotton/ canvas Fabric, which is biodegradable and eco-friendly, and can be used for a long time. 3. Extra Large Storage Bins : They can hold nearly a full load of toys or shoes at least a weeks work of laundry. 4. Easy to Carry and Move Around ZUEXT foldable laundry hamper is equipped with leather handles which are easy to carry and move. Each handle is reinforced and attached to the hamper with extra-strength stitching so the hamper can handle a heavy load. 5. Easy to Care: HAND WASH ONLY , softly brush the outside cotton, and the inside could be wiped down with a wet cloth. 6. Collapsible Design can save space when not in use. 7. Other Intended Uses The Decorative Storage Bins and Baskets are not only good household life helpers but also charming decorations. With a little bit of ironing, it will work pretty well as a temporary planter cover . Package Includes 1x Foldable Canvas Fabric Storage Bin Notes -Pls allow 1-2cm of size difference by manual measurement. -ZUEXT clothes hamper comes folded in a flat bag, so it may get a little wrinkly. But once unfolded and left upright for a few hours, the wrinkles would go away. Or you can softly iron it at low temperature before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+bDbnQBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUEXT","source_asin":"B07H6NHM84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H6NHM84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H6NHM84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1050630,"name":"BambooMN Custom Laser Engraved Bamboo Cutting Board - Letter Script Monogram Thin - 1 Piece - 15\" x 9.5\" x 0.75\" (Wide Stripes)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sajt6AOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT: Check spelling and desired engraving closely, we will engrave only what you write. Pictures are just recommendations for engraving designs and do not suggest any required or assumed text will be engraved. If you wish to not include one or multiple pieces of text in your engraving simply leave the engraving blank. If you wish to engrave multiple words in the \"engraved text\" section, those words may be split up onto multiple lines in order to make them more appealing and readable. PREMIUM BAMBOO: We use high quality bamboo and are proud of our craftsmanship. Coloration of cutting board may slightly vary compared to the picture shown due to the manufacturing process. Due to the nature of natural bamboo, the outcome of each board may vary. Meaning some spots may be darker or lighter compared to others. We never know how the bamboo will take the laser engraving, but we always try our best to filter out the boards before we start engraving to ensure your satisfaction. PERFECT FOR ANY OCCASION: Great gift for weddings – engagement - anniversary – couples – promotions – clients – housewarming - retirement and much more. TOP 5 BENEFITS OF BAMBOO: 1.) Highly Sustainable & Renewable; 2.) Light & Elegant; 3.) Self-Healing and Easier on Knives; 4.) Durable - Stronger than traditional wood; 5.) Less Water Retention. EASY TO MAINTAIN: Wash with warm water and occasionally use oil to extend life and beauty. Cutting boards are coated with a light coat of oil after being engraved, but it is recommended that you add more oil of your own if you plan to use the board for serving or preparing food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sajt6AOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BambooMN","source_asin":"B07FQRK6DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FQRK6DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FQRK6DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
