window.products.push({"id":1050658,"name":"Silicone Cooking Utensils Set, Deedro 27 Pcs Kitchen Utensils Set Silicone Spatula Set, Heat Resistant Kitchen Gadgets Tools Set with Wooden Handle fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNUCWGf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍐【SAFE UTENSILS FOR COOKING】Deedro silicone kitchen utensils are made of food-grade silicone, BPA free, which is safe to use for any type of food, keeping our health safe from harmful toxins and chemicals. This silicone kitchen utensil set does not react with food or beverages, or produce any noxious odors at high temperatures. Great silicone utensils set to protect your nonstick cookware, will not scratch any pots or pans like metals do. 🍐【EXCELLENT HEAT RESISTANCE】The cooking utensil set can withstand very high heat, up to 446℉/230℃, even if they are used under high temperature condition of frying, you don't have to worry that it will melt when you accidentally leave it in the pot for a while. Soft silicone won't scratch your nonstick cookware. Will not retain smells or colors when you use it for mixing or stirring deep-colored food. These are great gadgets to extend the life of all your kitchen pans. 🍐【STURDY WOODEN HANDLE】Silicone cookware set is ergonomically designed for comfortable grip, well crafted and non corrosive. Solid wooden cookware handles gives a vintage feel and will not burn your hands. Compared with stainless steel handle, it won’t become too hot to touch if the utensil is leaving in the pot while cooking. Add stainless steel core to enhance durability and toughness to keep the spatulas from bending or deforming. 🍐【IDEAL GIFT FOR YOUR FAMILIES/FRIENDS】The variety of kitchen tools ensure you have exactly what is needed at hand for the perfect meal every time. Grill, mix ingredients, stir sauces, whip cream, flip eggs or pancakes, pan fry or stir fry as much as you wish. Food grade silicone combine with smooth wooden handle ensures daily use for a long time without being worn down. This kitchenware set is great gift for your families, friends or anyone who loves cooking. 🍐【CONVENIENT FOR MAINTENANCE】Each one has a utility hole on the handle for easy hanging, help you store all your kitchen gadgets conveniently and keep tidy. Also come with a complimentary storage bucket that helps you save space in your drawers while keeping your utensils within easy reach. The nonstick silicone heads make it easy to clean by hand in warm soapy water, simply wipe under hot water. We recommend hand washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNUCWGf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deedro","source_asin":"B08P4TMT4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4TMT4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4TMT4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
