window.products.push({"id":1050743,"name":"Milk Bottle with Lid AND Pourer Multi-Pack. 32 Oz Reusable Glass Bottles with 6 Lids! Jug Pitcher, Buttermilk, Water or Juice Bottles with Caps, Syrup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5116Ck0mcHL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","description":"NOSTALGIC AND PRACTICAL: Whether you remember them as a kid or not, we can all agree old milk bottles are both charming and sturdy. So we decided to revive the nostalgia with this set of milk storage containers, but with a modern upgrade. They come with 6 reusable milk bottle lids and pour spout! EASY TO GRIP, SPILL PROOF POUR: Each 32oz large glass bottle is 3.3” square that is as easy to hold as it is satisfying! Plus, it goes without saying, it’s easier to shake than a pitcher or jug. And when it’s time to pour, snap on the silicone dispenser cap for a spill proof stream of liquid. EASY TO CLEAN: Because we use such thick glass, the milk storage bottle is robust for cleaning. It’s 100% Dishwasher Safe (not the lids), or you can use a standard bottle brush for this half gallon milk jug. But here’s another tip from our Kitchen Dept – add uncooked rice plus hot soapy water and shake! ODORLESS, LEAD AND BPA FREE: Plastic milk bottles can leave a bad taste in your mouth. But our crystal clear lead-free glass milk container won’t. Each square bottle is 3.34” wide, and stands 10.2” tall to fit neatly in the refrigerator. The plastic lids and silicone pourer are BPA, BPA and Phthalate Free LEAKPROOF CAPS, TAMPER PROOF DESIGN: The first time you use our press on caps, you’ll discover the tamper proof seal, ideal if you’re gifting filled glass bottles with caps, or to keep kids out of homemade nut mylk! After the seal is broken the press-on caps are reusable and remain leakproof. WHAT WILL YOURS BE USED FOR? Go nuts, they’re empty bottles for drinks of all kinds! Oat or nut milk glass bottles, yes! Homemade milk container or raw milk storage bottles, of course! Are you a juicer? They’re great juicing bottles. Coffee syrup bottles, breastmilk or iced tea. Also a great sun tea jar! POUR WITH JOY! Your set of 3 containers for milk, 6 lids and 1 pourer will arrive beautifully and safely gift boxed, with our robust 12-Month Warranty. So you can gift it with confidence to someone who also loves storing things in robust, odorless glass milk bottles with lids. Pour with Joy! And JoyJolt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5116Ck0mcHL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0BLT3LHD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLT3LHD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLT3LHD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
