window.products.push({"id":1050815,"name":"Bion, Large Evil Eye Wall Hanging, Turkish Evil Eye, Greek Evil Eye - Big Evil Eye Wall Decor, Turkish Evil Eye, Greek Evil Eye, Nazar, Evil Eye Bead ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+N2BkiC-L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Chances are you have seen this famous symbol many times. You’ve probably even worn one and you’ve definitely seen someone wearing an evil eye amulet. You may have witnessed a person give the “evil eye” look (and you may have even given it yourself). But do you know the deep and meaningful history of the evil eye symbol, and do you know how popular and prevalent the evil eye is throughout a plethora of different cultures? Below is the need-to-know information on the symbol that is so popular. Turkish evil eye , \"Nazar Boncugu\" in Turkish language. Mostly beleived in Turkey, Greece and Israel; evil eye figure gives people good luck and protects from jealous looks :) This big size evil eye wall hanging give your home positive energy. Evil eye wall decor will add color to your home with its special design. Evil eye home decor will be one of the most rare decorations in your home with rustic, oriental style. As you look at the bazaar you will feel away from the stress of the day. In different languages, the evil eye is known as: Hebrew Evil Eye – Ayin Ha’ra Turkish Evil Eye – Nazar Boncugu Italian Evil Eye – Mal Occhio Farsi – Bla Band Arabic – Ayin Harsha Scotland – Droch Shuil Spanish – Mal Ojo or El Oja France – Mauvais Oeil Germany – Böser Blick Romans – Oculus Malus The Eye of Providence (or the all-seeing eye of God) is a symbol, having its origin in Christian iconography, showing an eye often surrounded by rays of light or a glory and usually enclosed by a triangle. It represents the eye of God watching over humanity (the concept of divine providence).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+N2BkiC-L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bion","source_asin":"B07MS7D6DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MS7D6DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MS7D6DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
