window.products.push({"id":1050843,"name":"Homdox Bedding Sets, 4 Piece (1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 Pillowcases), Wrinkle and Fade Resistant, Deep Pockets Hypoallergenic Microfiber - Soft ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eUXe2aQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Homdox Bed Sheet Sets Bed Sheets will be extremely soft after first wash; Homdox 500 Thread Count Polyester Bedding Sheets are light weight and the best choice for the musser nights. the higher Thread Count bed sheets are designed for winter or autunm days The Perfect Fit and Choice Bedding Sheet Sets come in Twin, Full, Queen, King and california King and Red Brown, Light Coffee, Green, Dark Coffee, Beige colors for choice; 500 thread count polyester Made from 500 thread count polyester , the bedding sheet sets are advantages of 500 thread count, stain resistance, wrinkle resistance; Homdox bed sheet sets offers both insulating warmth and comfortable breathability, besides its durable and softable Package Content: 1 flat sheet 1 fitted sheet 2 pillowcases How to Clean Bed Sheets polyester bed sheets have strong alkali resistance, not acid, high temperature resistance, available soap or other cleaning detergents; There will be a little colors remaining in the water for the first and twice washing, that's the residual dye on the fabric surface, but it will come off after the first washing 1. To soak for a 5 to 8-minute before washing them(Not to soak the polyester bed sheets with stains in the hot water, to avoid becoming yellowish ) 2. While washing, following the rule--Don't wash with lots of water but to wash bed sheet set for several times; what's more, bedding sheets should be wrung out every time before a second time wash so as to improve cleaning efficiency. 4. If possible, you could hang the wet opposite side of bed sheets out in the sun to dry for about an hour and then dry in the shade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eUXe2aQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B01H3E9UD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H3E9UD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H3E9UD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
