window.products.push({"id":1050871,"name":"Mind Reader Triple Cereal Dispenser, Canister, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FfVuOHwUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mind Reader food dispensers are the perfect space-saving multi-purpose home, office, hospitality and restaurant solution for organizing granulated dry goods including coffee, sugar, dry cereal, granola, m&m candies, skittles, dog food and more. Sturdy and heavy base dispensers are made of light-weight plastic containers with weighted, heavy base bottoms for stability, sturdiness and tip-resistance. Perfect for kitchen countertops, office counters or tables, pantry shelves, kitchen or office cabinets or hospitality areas at hotels and motels where they offer condiment or beverage service. Dispensers are for dry goods only and dispense small amounts per pull. Use for ground coffee, granulated cereals, cinnamon, spices, sugar, salt, pepper - any granulated or small size dry good that requires a measured dispense will work with this kitchen friendly food-safe dispenser. Portion control dispensers are the perfect mess minimizer for home kitchens, restaurant kitchens, kitchen counters, office breakroom kitchens, small cafe and eateries, food trucks with minimal space, hospitality locations at hotels, doctor's offices, motels, car sales showrooms and more. Mind Reader space saving office and home solutions help to organize all of your home and office needs. Perfect for student dorm rooms or common areas where students can share with each other - dorm employees offices for late night coffee - college food areas where space and cleanliness are paramount. Organize your pantry or countertop array of commonly used spices for everyday cooking - granulated salt, garlic, garlic salt, oregano, paprika and more - multiple Mind Reader dispensers can organize your entire kitchen. Child friendly food dispensers control portions and eliminate dry spills from pouring or over-filled containers - children become more responsible and self sufficient in the kitchen. Reduce the ability for dirt, dust or other unwanted items from getting into incorrectly closed food bags or containers - Container twists closed onto dispenser base for a sealed closure. Contemporary, modern design makes a great housewarming gift or wedding gift - add pantry filling items with dispensers to make an overwhelming gift basket for the new home owners - flavored coffees, organic natural sugars, new cooking spices - help them to get organized from the beginning - new couples will love you for it! Make life easier for your parents, grandparents, best friends with Mind Reader organizing and space-saving solutions for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FfVuOHwUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B077J6HDCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1050871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077J6HDCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077J6HDCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
